::::: frame
### So What Is Geometric Growth?

:::: block
Discrete time, $t=1,2,\ldots$

::: center
$N_t = N_0(1+r)^t$
:::

$r$ = discrete-time version of intrinsic rate of increase
::::
:::::

::::::: frame
